# Cross-origin isolation for the Godot web build under /snake (it needs
# SharedArrayBuffer, which browsers only expose on isolated pages). Applied
# site-wide, exactly as routes/_middleware.tsx did on Fresh, because the
# game runs in a same-origin iframe and isolation is decided by the
# top-level document.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
